title: Fake operating-system update screen
severity: high
score: 55
tags: clickfix, fake-update, jackfix
attack: T1204.004, T1036, T1059
description: A non-vendor page goes full screen with fake 'installing updates... 37%' OS
  update text and blocks DevTools/keys or stages a clipboard command (JackFix). This
  prepares the visitor for paste-and-run steps.
---
// A fake OS-update screen that goes fullscreen ...
fake_os_update_pages
| where exists(fullscreen_requests)
// ... and blocks DevTools, locks the keyboard or puts a command on the clipboard.
| where exists(devtools_keys_blocked) or exists(keyboard_lock_requests) or exists(clipboard_commands)
